WEBVTT

00:00:00.820 --> 00:00:02.810
Well then, here's to our beloved Yuma...

00:00:02.810 --> 00:00:04.440
...passing the W.D.C...

00:00:04.440 --> 00:00:05.980
...right into the Tournament Finals!

00:00:05.980 --> 00:00:08.690
To summarize, he won the Semi-Finals and advanced!

00:00:08.690 --> 00:00:10.780
Congratulations...

00:00:11.180 --> 00:00:13.240
Cheers!

00:00:15.310 --> 00:00:16.990
Phew, thanks a bunch!

00:00:16.990 --> 00:00:18.620
Yuma's incredible!

00:00:18.620 --> 00:00:20.750
I can't believe he made it through the Semi-Finals!

00:00:21.830 --> 00:00:25.460
C'mon, Kotori... Cheer up.

00:00:25.460 --> 00:00:28.040
Oh my, are you <i>still</i> angry?

00:00:29.210 --> 00:00:33.090
After being left behind by Yuma on the Canyon Field...

00:00:33.470 --> 00:00:34.820
What gives?!

00:00:34.820 --> 00:00:35.550
Cat!

00:00:35.550 --> 00:00:38.720
I said I was sorry! I was so engrossed in the Duel...

00:00:38.720 --> 00:00:40.560
Engrossed by butt!

00:00:40.560 --> 00:00:43.890
You suck. Don't fuss.
 You suck. Don't fuss.

00:00:43.890 --> 00:00:47.420
Kiddies, the snacks are ready.

00:00:47.420 --> 00:00:49.060
G-Grandma...

00:00:49.520 --> 00:00:51.610
Wow, looks great!

00:00:51.610 --> 00:00:52.690
It looks yummy!

00:00:52.690 --> 00:00:55.400
Eat as much as you like.

00:00:55.400 --> 00:00:57.240
I'm starved!

00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:00.990
Hey!

00:01:03.770 --> 00:01:04.340
Grandma?

00:01:05.230 --> 00:01:07.190
You must express your gratitude before you begin.

00:01:07.940 --> 00:01:09.710
You must pay your respects to the Duels!

00:01:10.380 --> 00:01:13.050
So be sure to show your gratitude.

00:01:13.720 --> 00:01:15.470
Thanks for the food!

00:01:16.380 --> 00:01:20.140
But you know, Yuma... there's bound to be a bunch of formidable opponents left.

00:01:20.140 --> 00:01:22.720
Shark, and Kaito, and Tron.

00:01:23.560 --> 00:01:26.230
I don't care who it is! Bring 'em on!

00:01:28.040 --> 00:01:29.770
Cat it to 'em, Yuma!

00:01:29.770 --> 00:01:32.980
Goodness... You barely won as it is.

00:01:32.980 --> 00:01:35.530
I'll handle it, Kotori!

00:01:36.290 --> 00:01:41.080
<i>It's true that we must not rush in
 unprepared against those remaining.</i>

00:01:41.790 --> 00:01:44.700
<i>Tron's Number is aided by the power of his Crest...</i>

00:01:45.390 --> 00:01:48.540
<i>Kaito has his incredibly powerful Neo Galaxy Eyes.</i>

00:01:49.390 --> 00:01:51.040
<i>And Shark...</i>

00:01:52.460 --> 00:01:55.010
<i>What was with that Chaos Number?</i>

00:01:56.470 --> 00:01:58.550
<i>Why does he </i>have<i> a Chaos Number?</i>

00:01:59.590 --> 00:02:02.680
I'm definitely gonna win the Duel Carnival!

00:02:05.310 --> 00:02:08.560
Yeah! As long as I got this deck a' mine with me...

00:02:08.850 --> 00:02:11.440
<i>And who exactly is Dr. Faker...?</i>

00:02:11.440 --> 00:02:12.860
It's gone~!

00:02:14.360 --> 00:02:17.360
It's gone! Gone! Gone! My deck's gone!

00:02:17.360 --> 00:02:20.030
I lost my deck~!

00:02:20.840 --> 00:02:25.890
<i>Advance, advance, beyond the limits of your strength</i>

00:02:26.180 --> 00:02:31.230
<i>Come along with me and burn our flame of life</i>

00:02:44.080 --> 00:02:48.080
<i>Hey, my friends, what scenery do you suppose</i>

00:02:49.210 --> 00:02:53.880
<i>awaits us on the other side of this hill?</i>

00:02:54.670 --> 00:02:58.470
<i>Hey, my friends, let's climb it together</i>

00:02:59.840 --> 00:03:04.510
<i>It's too late for us to turn back now</i>

00:03:05.100 --> 00:03:09.600
<i>The time has come to combine
 together the power dwelling inside me</i>

00:03:10.350 --> 00:03:15.150
<i>Gotta release my Soul Drive</i>

00:03:15.940 --> 00:03:20.950
<i>Advance, advance, beyond the limits of your strength</i>

00:03:21.160 --> 00:03:25.990
<i>Come along with me and burn our flame of life</i>

00:03:26.540 --> 00:03:31.460
<i>Keep running, keep running, until you get there</i>

00:03:31.790 --> 00:03:37.130
<i>Once again, once again, keep those challenges coming</i>

00:03:38.210 --> 00:03:43.300
<i>My friends, keep on living in the here and now</i>

00:03:43.590 --> 00:03:49.390
<i>Keep pressing onward together no matter what happens</i>

00:03:52.670 --> 00:03:55.590
Gosh... I seriously can't believe this!

00:03:55.460 --> 00:04:00.170
"Number 60: The Overture Towards the Final Battle:
 The New Foe Dr. Faker!"

00:03:55.710 --> 00:03:57.460
You actually lost your important deck...

00:03:57.880 --> 00:04:01.340
It can't be helped.
 It's already lost, after all...

00:04:02.050 --> 00:04:04.390
So is it really here?

00:04:04.590 --> 00:04:07.350
Yes! There's a GPS feature attached to our deck cases

00:04:07.470 --> 00:04:10.100
that operates together with our D-Pads.

00:04:10.680 --> 00:04:12.940
Which means Yuma-<i>kun</i>'s deck case is...

00:04:13.520 --> 00:04:15.190
...here in Heartland!

00:04:17.440 --> 00:04:20.320
Excuse me! Is there anyone here?

00:04:20.440 --> 00:04:21.860
Please open the door!

00:04:22.320 --> 00:04:25.160
It'll only take a second, so please do this for me!

00:04:25.490 --> 00:04:28.580
Hey, please open it!
 Open it!

00:04:28.660 --> 00:04:32.120
Open it! Open up already! Open up!!

00:04:34.870 --> 00:04:38.920
Guess they won't open it no matter what.
 Then we just gotta climb over and pass through!

00:04:39.630 --> 00:04:41.590
That's obviously not possible!

00:04:42.220 --> 00:04:45.090
If I just think of it as the 30 step jumping blocks...!

00:04:48.300 --> 00:04:50.390
I'm gonna bring it...

00:04:51.930 --> 00:04:53.520
...to 'em!

00:04:59.730 --> 00:05:02.070
Darn~!

00:05:18.630 --> 00:05:19.790
I did it!

00:05:26.050 --> 00:05:28.720
It really is impossible to sneak in.

00:05:29.430 --> 00:05:32.430
Gosh... You really are an idiot.

00:05:34.560 --> 00:05:36.890
There's trucks entering over there.

00:05:37.270 --> 00:05:41.360
Yeah, that's the place where the trash collected by the O-Bots from the trash bins are returned.

00:05:44.030 --> 00:05:46.820
I just had a light bulb! It's the hidden side of this joint!

00:05:47.820 --> 00:05:50.580
Eh?! We're gonna hide inside these trash bins?!

00:05:51.160 --> 00:05:51.990
That's correct.

00:05:52.410 --> 00:05:55.540
When they go to return the trash the O-Bots take from the trash bins,

00:05:55.540 --> 00:05:57.370
we can sneak inside Heartland!

00:05:57.750 --> 00:05:59.210
That sounds like it could work!

00:05:59.580 --> 00:06:00.420
So, I'll...

00:06:00.790 --> 00:06:01.130
Eh?

00:06:01.710 --> 00:06:04.590
Yuma-<i>kun</i>, I'm preying for your success!

00:06:05.920 --> 00:06:08.260
H-Hey! That rascal...

00:06:08.760 --> 00:06:11.050
Okay! Let's get this done with!

00:06:11.970 --> 00:06:12.760
Hey, hold it!

00:06:13.220 --> 00:06:15.600
Huh? He really got inside there!

00:06:16.600 --> 00:06:19.650
Gosh, it can't be helped.
 Help me out, Tetsuo-<i>kun</i>.

00:06:19.980 --> 00:06:21.900
Huh? You don't really expect me to go in there?

00:06:22.520 --> 00:06:25.400
But I'm worried about Yuma going alone.

00:06:25.610 --> 00:06:26.820
C'mon...

00:06:26.820 --> 00:06:27.570
Just cat a moment!

00:06:28.280 --> 00:06:31.450
There's only one more trash bin!
 I won't let Kotori take it from me!

00:06:31.910 --> 00:06:36.910
Eh? I don't really want to go inside a trash bin <i>that</i> badly...

00:06:35.290 --> 00:06:38.160
It's really sly of you to try to go together with Yuma, cat.

00:06:38.660 --> 00:06:41.580
And I don't really think you'd be of any use, Kotori.

00:06:42.500 --> 00:06:43.710
*Clank~*

00:06:43.710 --> 00:06:47.920
Um, in that case, Cat-<i>chan</i> can go in my place.

00:06:47.920 --> 00:06:50.010
Fine then! We'll decide this with rock, paper, scissors!

00:06:50.340 --> 00:06:51.470
That's exactly what I wanted!

00:06:51.930 --> 00:06:52.600
Eh?!

00:06:53.050 --> 00:06:54.600
Rock, paper, scissors! Shoot!

00:06:55.180 --> 00:06:57.430
Shoot! Shoot! Shoot!

00:06:57.430 --> 00:06:59.310
Is this how humans show affection for one another?

00:07:00.650 --> 00:07:02.900
Or is it simply their fighting spirit?

00:07:04.770 --> 00:07:06.480
Oh yeah! I won!

00:07:08.360 --> 00:07:09.530
I get to go in the trash bi-

00:07:11.110 --> 00:07:13.120
Will you guys hurry it up already?!

00:07:13.530 --> 00:07:14.450
- Right...
 - Right...

00:07:19.790 --> 00:07:24.920
Cleaning! Cleaning! Cleaning! Cleaning!

00:07:28.420 --> 00:07:29.170
H-Hold on!

00:07:31.010 --> 00:07:32.640
Trash rejected. Trash rejected.

00:07:36.810 --> 00:07:39.890
Huh? Why? Hang on a minute!

00:07:40.100 --> 00:07:42.480
I'm trash enough for this! Wait up!

00:07:47.150 --> 00:07:50.440
Look, everything went as I said it would, didn't it?

00:07:51.030 --> 00:07:52.410
The plan is proceeding well.

00:07:52.780 --> 00:07:55.570
Tomorrow, all the Numbers will belong to me.

00:07:58.240 --> 00:08:02.580
But I have to make them pay for rendering III, IV, and V as sacrifices.

00:08:03.540 --> 00:08:05.960
It's a pity, but it was unavoidable.

00:08:06.540 --> 00:08:08.250
But they've done well.

00:08:08.670 --> 00:08:10.670
I expected no less from my sons.

00:08:15.550 --> 00:08:16.680
It seems he's come.

00:08:19.640 --> 00:08:21.180
<i>IV... You...</i>

00:08:21.890 --> 00:08:23.230
<i>But I beg you...</i>

00:08:23.230 --> 00:08:25.440
<i>Please save Tron, my father!</i>

00:08:26.520 --> 00:08:27.190
<i>Ryoga,</i>

00:08:28.440 --> 00:08:30.440
<i>you'll definitely able to save my father!</i>

00:08:31.650 --> 00:08:32.320
<i>Tron...!</i>

00:08:33.990 --> 00:08:36.990
<i>You're the one who incriminated me and injured my sister!</i>

00:08:37.490 --> 00:08:38.990
<i>You're responsible for everything!</i>

00:08:40.790 --> 00:08:42.910
<i>I won't let you get away with it at any cost!</i>

00:08:44.250 --> 00:08:45.500
Tron!

00:08:54.430 --> 00:08:56.430
I've been waiting, Ryoga.

00:08:57.550 --> 00:08:58.180
Tron!

00:09:10.480 --> 00:09:12.190
Where are you, Tron?! Where did you go?!

00:09:25.160 --> 00:09:26.290
I caught you.

00:09:27.000 --> 00:09:28.790
Now you belong to <i>me</i>...

00:09:29.670 --> 00:09:34.470
You probably believe that you overcame your darkness in that Duel before,

00:09:34.470 --> 00:09:36.550
but it was all as I planned.

00:09:37.380 --> 00:09:40.260
IV worked diligently for this, after all.

00:09:40.260 --> 00:09:42.470
Now I'll spread it...

00:09:42.680 --> 00:09:44.230
The darkness in your heart.

00:09:45.270 --> 00:09:47.440
I'll make it into a darkness that far exceeds what it was!

00:10:19.010 --> 00:10:19.760
That's...

00:10:20.720 --> 00:10:22.010
Yuma Tsukumo...

00:10:23.100 --> 00:10:25.720
Gosh! Treating a lady like trash...!

00:10:26.060 --> 00:10:28.060
But now we were able to get in!

00:10:43.530 --> 00:10:44.740
Oh crap! We're gonna fall!

00:10:50.830 --> 00:10:52.540
We're falling! Save us!

00:10:53.670 --> 00:10:54.420
Yuma!

00:11:02.050 --> 00:11:04.640
Huh? I-It stopped...

00:11:06.720 --> 00:11:08.310
Huh? That's...

00:11:12.560 --> 00:11:15.020
Phew... We're saved.

00:11:15.400 --> 00:11:16.570
What is this place?

00:11:19.610 --> 00:11:22.030
Huh? Is this all trash?

00:11:22.450 --> 00:11:23.280
Amazing...

00:11:24.200 --> 00:11:28.250
Why's there such a huge garbage disposal underneath Heartland?

00:11:36.750 --> 00:11:38.340
<i>What was that vision just now...?</i>

00:11:39.340 --> 00:11:41.510
<i>There's something happening here...</i>

00:11:48.850 --> 00:11:49.350
Yuma.

00:11:49.680 --> 00:11:50.020
Huh?

00:11:50.980 --> 00:11:52.270
Haruto is above us.

00:11:52.940 --> 00:11:53.270
Huh?

00:11:55.110 --> 00:11:55.940
Haruto is?!

00:12:06.490 --> 00:12:07.790
No one's here.

00:12:08.290 --> 00:12:09.620
Are you really going in here?

00:12:10.200 --> 00:12:11.620
Yeah, so let's go.

00:12:19.050 --> 00:12:21.340
<i>Haruto... Haruto!</i>

00:12:23.510 --> 00:12:24.180
Where are we?!

00:12:25.220 --> 00:12:26.600
There's an elevator over there!

00:12:27.300 --> 00:12:28.970
Maybe he really is above us!

00:12:30.560 --> 00:12:31.680
Alright, let's go!

00:12:32.230 --> 00:12:32.690
Huh?

00:12:33.560 --> 00:12:34.140
What the?

00:12:35.060 --> 00:12:38.190
<i>Intruder detected. Intruder detected.</i>

00:12:39.730 --> 00:12:42.650
<i>Intruders will be eliminated through a Duel.</i>

00:12:43.900 --> 00:12:45.740
Wh-What'll we do?!

00:12:46.320 --> 00:12:48.450
If it wants to Duel, we're just gonna have to do it!

00:12:53.750 --> 00:12:56.040
<i>AR Vision - Link established.</i>

00:12:56.710 --> 00:12:57.380
Duel!!

00:12:58.250 --> 00:13:00.420
S-Something just appeared!

00:13:01.710 --> 00:13:02.340
What is it?

00:13:03.340 --> 00:13:04.220
Look!

00:13:07.890 --> 00:13:09.350
A bunch of cards just appeared!

00:13:12.930 --> 00:13:15.810
They're all Xyz Monster Cards?

00:13:17.480 --> 00:13:21.230
I Summon Scrap Recycler.

00:13:26.740 --> 00:13:27.820
A Monster appeared!

00:13:29.160 --> 00:13:30.580
Oh! I see!

00:13:31.080 --> 00:13:33.290
All the cards here are Xyz Monsters!

00:13:36.330 --> 00:13:39.790
Hey, Kotori, jump on the 3 panel in front of you!

00:13:41.250 --> 00:13:41.800
This?

00:13:44.050 --> 00:13:47.720
Okay! I Xyz Summon with the two Level Threes!

00:13:48.590 --> 00:13:51.220
Come forth, Wind-up Zenmaines!

00:13:52.930 --> 00:13:54.430
An Xyz Monster!

00:13:54.730 --> 00:13:55.520
He did it!

00:13:55.850 --> 00:13:58.020
Go! Wind-up Zenmaines!

00:13:58.520 --> 00:14:00.360
Attack Recycler!

00:14:03.730 --> 00:14:04.740
Alright!

00:14:04.990 --> 00:14:08.070
I Summon Scrap Searcher!

00:14:14.120 --> 00:14:15.330
Another one came out.

00:14:15.790 --> 00:14:18.370
Yuma, leave this to us and go on ahead!

00:14:18.670 --> 00:14:18.960
Huh?!

00:14:19.500 --> 00:14:20.750
Just get going already!

00:14:21.040 --> 00:14:21.670
Tetsuo...

00:14:22.540 --> 00:14:25.170
You want to meet Haruto-<i>kun</i>, don't you, Yuma?!

00:14:28.090 --> 00:14:29.890
Okay. I'm counting on you!

00:14:33.010 --> 00:14:33.560
Yuma!

00:14:36.430 --> 00:14:38.140
Hey, this way, useless robot!

00:14:40.310 --> 00:14:41.860
We're your opponents here!

00:14:42.230 --> 00:14:44.320
Kotori, press two Level Ones!

00:14:44.980 --> 00:14:48.280
Two ones... One... One... Here!

00:14:49.410 --> 00:14:54.200
I use three Level Ones to conduct an Xyz Summon! Come forth, Mira the Giant Star!

00:14:54.910 --> 00:14:57.290
Go! Attack Searcher!

00:15:00.620 --> 00:15:02.290
Finally found it!

00:15:02.750 --> 00:15:05.630
I Summon Scrap Hunter.

00:15:09.010 --> 00:15:10.630
Kotori, press Level Two!

00:15:10.930 --> 00:15:11.800
Okay!

00:15:12.890 --> 00:15:15.010
Come forth, Shining Elf!

00:15:18.600 --> 00:15:21.190
I'm counting on you guys! Tetsuo! Kotori!

00:15:25.770 --> 00:15:27.280
I reached it!

00:15:36.290 --> 00:15:37.120
Oh crap!

00:15:37.490 --> 00:15:38.540
Just how many does it have?!

00:15:45.670 --> 00:15:47.590
Th-This is Haruto's...

00:15:55.050 --> 00:15:55.680
Haruto...

00:16:02.690 --> 00:16:07.360
It seems like Haruto still hasn't regained consciousness from that time.

00:16:12.530 --> 00:16:13.450
You know, Haruto...

00:16:14.360 --> 00:16:17.120
I'm gonna win the Duel Carnival.

00:16:19.580 --> 00:16:22.580
I will definitely beat that Tron down, and return as the champion.

00:16:24.670 --> 00:16:27.750
I won't hold back against even your brother, Kaito, when the time comes.

00:16:28.460 --> 00:16:28.920
So...

00:16:30.130 --> 00:16:30.710
So please...

00:16:36.180 --> 00:16:36.680
Haruto...

00:16:37.890 --> 00:16:38.310
I...

00:16:39.560 --> 00:16:42.270
If I hadn't let Tron and the others take you that night...

00:16:43.390 --> 00:16:43.890
I...

00:16:51.740 --> 00:16:55.200
Yuma... Yuma.

00:17:02.080 --> 00:17:02.660
Where are we?

00:17:02.960 --> 00:17:04.330
Yuma. Astral.

00:17:08.500 --> 00:17:13.090
I always believed that you guys would come here eventually.

00:17:13.880 --> 00:17:16.340
Haruto! Haruto, you...

00:17:17.340 --> 00:17:18.430
I have a favor to ask of you.

00:17:19.430 --> 00:17:21.010
Please save my brother.

00:17:21.600 --> 00:17:21.890
Huh?

00:17:23.350 --> 00:17:25.100
My brother is already pretty tired.

00:17:26.060 --> 00:17:29.690
But I don't have the power to save my brother.

00:17:30.900 --> 00:17:32.400
And I cannot get out of here.

00:17:33.610 --> 00:17:36.990
Please, save my brother.

00:17:39.740 --> 00:17:40.870
Hey, Haruto!

00:17:47.670 --> 00:17:48.670
That was...

00:17:49.250 --> 00:17:50.250
Haruto's consciousness.

00:17:50.790 --> 00:17:51.750
Haruto's consciousness?

00:17:52.380 --> 00:17:53.010
Most likely,

00:17:53.510 --> 00:17:57.590
Haruto’s true consciousness was sealed deep inside his heart.

00:17:58.510 --> 00:18:01.180
If we are able to release his true consciousness,

00:18:01.720 --> 00:18:03.470
maybe Haruto can recover from this.

00:18:04.180 --> 00:18:06.140
Then how should we do that?

00:18:06.890 --> 00:18:12.320
I am not sure either. But maybe it has something to do with Kaito collecting Numbers.

00:18:12.730 --> 00:18:13.440
Eh?!

00:18:15.110 --> 00:18:15.690
Then...

00:18:17.030 --> 00:18:17.610
Haruto...

00:18:19.200 --> 00:18:23.040
If I start collecting Numbers, Haruto may never get cured!

00:18:23.490 --> 00:18:25.290
But if Kaito collects them…

00:18:26.000 --> 00:18:28.330
What the heck should I do?!

00:18:29.500 --> 00:18:30.880
You are the one who’s battling.

00:18:31.670 --> 00:18:32.790
Thus you should make that decision.

00:18:33.880 --> 00:18:36.880
But if I lose, you'll disappear!

00:18:38.010 --> 00:18:38.630
Yuma...

00:18:39.640 --> 00:18:44.010
While I Dueled alongside you, I have learned a lot from you.

00:18:45.270 --> 00:18:49.230
I started to think that I was glad I partnered with you.

00:18:50.940 --> 00:18:53.110
I will follow the path you choose.

00:18:54.110 --> 00:18:55.780
No matter what kind of path it is.

00:18:56.440 --> 00:18:58.610
Astral... you...

00:19:00.280 --> 00:19:01.990
Why'd you have to say something like that?!

00:19:02.450 --> 00:19:04.700
You should shout and cry more than that!

00:19:05.240 --> 00:19:08.080
Just say, “Help me get back my memory! I don’t want to disappear like this!”

00:19:08.830 --> 00:19:11.500
That would help me harden my heart for the upcoming battles.

00:19:11.960 --> 00:19:14.960
And yet, why...? Why?!

00:19:15.960 --> 00:19:16.510
Yuma...

00:19:28.350 --> 00:19:30.940
My name is Dr. Faker.

00:19:31.060 --> 00:19:33.360
Dr. Faker?!

00:19:33.360 --> 00:19:35.730
Then you're Kaito and Haruto's dad?!

00:19:36.480 --> 00:19:43.120
Welcome, Kazuma Tsukumo's son, and the Original Number.

00:19:45.740 --> 00:19:47.790
He... knows about Astral!

00:19:48.540 --> 00:19:49.960
So you can see me, then.

00:19:50.790 --> 00:19:51.960
Dr. Faker.

00:19:52.290 --> 00:19:54.540
Why are you collecting the Numbers?!

00:19:55.340 --> 00:19:57.420
Aren't the Numbers my memories?!

00:19:58.090 --> 00:20:02.050
Hmph. I made a deal with the Varian World.

00:20:03.010 --> 00:20:04.010
Varian World...?

00:20:05.100 --> 00:20:09.850
Yes. Another different world that coexists with the Astral World.

00:20:11.640 --> 00:20:14.400
As long as I destroy the Astral World,

00:20:14.560 --> 00:20:17.480
I can obtain the strongest power.

00:20:17.520 --> 00:20:20.990
and become the ruler of this world!

00:20:21.530 --> 00:20:23.780
Cut the crap! For that reason,

00:20:24.240 --> 00:20:26.240
you forced Kaito to hunt the Numbers?!

00:20:26.950 --> 00:20:30.120
Don’t you know how much Haruto and Kaito are suffering because of that?

00:20:30.830 --> 00:20:32.750
Aren't the both of them your own children?!

00:20:33.330 --> 00:20:34.790
They are just some minor sacrifices.

00:20:35.040 --> 00:20:35.790
What!?

00:20:36.210 --> 00:20:40.130
In order to obtain the strongest power, sacrifices are unavoidable.

00:20:40.670 --> 00:20:43.510
Kaito, Haruto, and you, Yuma Tsukumo.

00:20:44.300 --> 00:20:46.430
As well as your father, Kazuma.

00:20:48.180 --> 00:20:51.850
People always need to strive to survive while giving up something.

00:20:53.230 --> 00:20:54.600
Do you really think that way?

00:20:55.060 --> 00:20:56.190
Original.

00:20:56.980 --> 00:21:01.110
I am looking forward to tomorrow’s matches.

00:21:14.370 --> 00:21:16.210
Shit... Ouch!

00:21:17.670 --> 00:21:18.540
My deck...

00:21:19.590 --> 00:21:22.550
Geez, treating people like trash again!

00:21:25.510 --> 00:21:26.680
Dr. Faker...

00:21:29.760 --> 00:21:32.020
<i>Heart Burning!</i>

00:21:33.640 --> 00:21:36.440
<i>The World Carnival finally reaches its Semi-Finals!</i>

00:21:37.150 --> 00:21:43.530
<i>Just who will be the strongest Duelist that wins the honor as the first-generation W.D.C. Champion?</i>

00:21:45.400 --> 00:21:47.110
<i>We will now announce the match-ups!</i>

00:21:48.990 --> 00:21:50.660
<i>Tron VS Kaito!</i>

00:21:52.330 --> 00:21:54.120
<i>Yuma VS Ryoga!</i>

00:21:59.040 --> 00:22:01.670
Astral, I'm definitely gonna win the championship...

00:22:02.420 --> 00:22:05.090
And I'll resolve everything with my own hands!

00:22:05.470 --> 00:22:05.800
Right.

00:22:06.510 --> 00:22:08.430
I'm gonna bring it to 'em!

00:22:10.430 --> 00:22:15.600
<i>We stand tall, until we have victory in our grasp</i>

00:22:15.810 --> 00:22:21.190
<i>Move on ahead, speeding up our throbbing beats</i>

00:22:26.820 --> 00:22:31.910
<i>Listen boys and girls, here's the secret to boys and girls like you</i>

00:22:32.280 --> 00:22:36.160
<i>You're really just so spontaneous, wild as can be</i>

00:22:36.160 --> 00:22:37.460
<i>I bet you didn't know?</i>

00:22:37.710 --> 00:22:40.170
<i>You might be a handful, but what's wrong with that?</i>

00:22:40.290 --> 00:22:42.790
<i>Be up to no good, but learn for real</i>

00:22:42.920 --> 00:22:48.010
<i>Go the unpredictable route and shuffle your cards with a goal in mind</i>

00:22:48.170 --> 00:22:53.350
<i>Whenever you feel like you've lost your way, just take a minute to close your eyes...</i>

00:22:53.430 --> 00:22:58.980
<i>Shout "stop!" with all you've got, and there's your boundary line.</i>

00:23:00.310 --> 00:23:05.440
<i>We stand tall, until we have victory in our grasp</i>

00:23:05.650 --> 00:23:10.950
<i>We won't just stop here, not when we don't want to have any regrets.</i>

00:23:11.110 --> 00:23:16.200
<i>Even if we get hurt, we can't just hesitate now</i>

00:23:16.410 --> 00:23:21.790
<i>We won't just give up, not when our future's a lot brighter than our today</i>

00:23:21.790 --> 00:23:27.050
<i>Seriousness... It'll only make us keep fighting even harder</i>

00:23:27.260 --> 00:23:32.550
<i>We'll always get as fascinated as we want, and we'll fight on every day</i>

00:23:40.690 --> 00:23:43.810
The W.D.C. Semi-Finals finally began!

00:23:44.480 --> 00:23:47.230
My opponent is Shark, and I'll give you everything I've got!

00:23:47.230 --> 00:23:49.150
Huh? Hey! Shark!!

00:23:49.150 --> 00:23:50.900
So this is the Duel Tower?

00:23:50.900 --> 00:23:53.450
That Shark seems kinda strange.

00:23:53.450 --> 00:23:55.530
It's probably the power of his Number...

00:23:55.530 --> 00:23:59.580
Yeah, I'll win! I will win this and awaken Shark!

00:23:59.580 --> 00:24:01.870
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ZeXal!

00:24:01.920 --> 00:24:06.040
"The Vanishing Bond!
 Yuma VS Shark: The fated Duel!!

00:24:06.380 --> 00:24:09.300
What did you say? I made your sister… !?

00:24:11.130 --> 00:24:11.930
Tron's family.

00:24:11.930 --> 00:24:12.930
Faker's family.

00:24:13.340 --> 00:24:15.260
Now that I think about it, they're all men!

00:24:15.680 --> 00:24:17.470
I really wanna have an all-men family!

00:24:17.640 --> 00:24:20.230
Observation #20: "Akari is a woman".

00:24:20.680 --> 00:24:21.980
You just realized that?!

00:24:22.600 --> 00:24:23.480
He disappeared.
